- @left_maj: We can form a majority government!
- @redred: Form a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">red</span> coalition ([+ bavaria_pot_rot_rot +]%)
- @rrgreen: Form a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">red</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">green</span> coalition ([+ bavaria_pot_rot_rot_grun +]%)
- @red_purple: Form a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ bsw_color +];">purple</span> coalition ([+ bavaria_pot_red_purple +]%)
- @groko: Let a <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Grand</span> <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">coalition</span> be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_groko +]%).
- @brombeer: Let a <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Black</span> + <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">berry</span> + <span style="color: [+ bsw_color +];">coalition</span> take power ([+ bavaria_pot_brombeer +]%).
- @ampel: Let a Bavarian <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">Traffic</span> <span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">Light</span> <span style="color: [+ fw_color +];">coalition</span> be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_traffic_light +]%).
- @jamaica: Let a Bavarian <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Ja</span><span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">mai</span><span style="color: [+ fw_color +];">can</span> coalition be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_jamaica +]%).
- @kenya: Let a <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Ken</span><span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">yan co</span><span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">alition</span> be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_kenya +]%).
- @midnight: Let a <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Mid</span><span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">night</span> coalition be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_schwarz_blau +]%).
- @tigerente: Let a <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Spe</span><span style="color: [+ fw_color +];">zi</span> coalition be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_tigerente +]%).
- @kiwi: Let a <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Ki</span><span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">wi</span> coalition be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_kiwi +]%).
- @redgreen: Let a <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">green</span> coalition be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_rot_grun +]%).
- @germany: Let a Bavarian-<span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">Ger</span><span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">ma</span><span style="color: [+ fw_color +];">ny</span> coalition be formed ([+ bavaria_pot_weimar_but_different +]%).
- @querfront: The <span style="color: [+ bsw_color +];">BSW</span> will tolerate the <span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">AfD</span>.
- @afd_maj: The <span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">AfD</span> secures a majority.
- @csu_maj: The <span style="color: [+ csu_color +];">csu</span> secures a majority.
- @spd_maj: The <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">SPD</span> secures a majority.
- @greens_maj: The <span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">Greens</span> secure a majority.

@left_maj
view-if: bavaria_pot_die_linke_maj >= 50
on-arrival: spd_relation -= 2; greens_relation -= 2; urban_linke += 0.3; bavaria_groko = 0; bavaria_traffic_light = 0; bavaria_rot_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_jamaica = 0; bavaria_rot_rot = 0; bavaria_kenya = 0; bavaria_schwarz_blau = 0; bavaria_tigerenten = 0; bavaria_kiwi = 0; bavaria_die_linke_maj = 1; bavaria_afd_maj = 0; bavaria_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_spd_maj = 0; bavaria_green_maj = 0; bavaria_csu_maj = 0; bavaria_weimar_but_different = 0; bavaria_red_purple = 0; bavaria_brombeer = 0; bavaria_querfront = 0;

