@rrgreen
view-if: bavaria_pot_rot_rot_grun >= 50
choose-if: spd_relation >= 40 and greens_relation >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with the moderate left aren't good enough.
on-arrival: spd_relation += 1; greens_relation += 1; bavaria_groko = 0; bavaria_traffic_light = 0; bavaria_rot_rot_grun = 1; bavaria_jamaica = 0; bavaria_rot_rot = 0; bavaria_kenya = 0; bavaria_schwarz_blau = 0; bavaria_tigerenten = 0; bavaria_kiwi = 0; bavaria_die_linke_maj = 0; bavaria_afd_maj = 0; bavaria_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_spd_maj = 0; bavaria_green_maj = 0; bavaria_csu_maj = 0; bavaria_weimar_but_different = 0; bavaria_red_purple = 0; bavaria_brombeer = 0; bavaria_querfront = 0;

We have formed a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">red</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">green</span> coalition with the moderate left.

@red_purple
view-if: bavaria_pot_red_purple >= 50 and bsw_r_bavaria > 0
choose-if: bsw_relation >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with Wagenknecht aren't good enough.
on-arrival: bsw_relation += 1; youth_linke -= 0.5; youth_greens += 0.5; bavaria_groko = 0; bavaria_traffic_light = 0; bavaria_rot_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_jamaica = 0; bavaria_rot_rot = 0; bavaria_kenya = 0; bavaria_schwarz_blau = 0; bavaria_tigerenten = 0; bavaria_kiwi = 0; bavaria_die_linke_maj = 0; bavaria_afd_maj = 0; bavaria_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_spd_maj = 0; bavaria_green_maj = 0; bavaria_csu_maj = 0; bavaria_weimar_but_different = 0; bavaria_red_purple = 1; bavaria_brombeer = 0; bavaria_querfront = 0;

We have formed a Red-purple coalition with the BSW.

@groko
view-if: bavaria_pot_groko >= 50 and bavaria_pot_spd_maj < 50 and bavaria_pot_csu_maj < 50
on-arrival: youth_spd -= 0.4; youth_linke += 0.2; youth_greens += 0.2; bavaria_groko = 1; bavaria_traffic_light = 0; bavaria_rot_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_jamaica = 0; bavaria_rot_rot = 0; bavaria_kenya = 0; bavaria_schwarz_blau = 0; bavaria_tigerenten = 0; bavaria_kiwi = 0; bavaria_die_linke_maj = 0; bavaria_afd_maj = 0; bavaria_rot_grun = 0; bavaria_spd_maj = 0; bavaria_green_maj = 0; bavaria_csu_maj = 0; bavaria_weimar_but_different = 0; bavaria_red_purple = 0; bavaria_brombeer = 0; bavaria_querfront = 0;

